I'm going to bed early today."],["kommen","v","kommt · kam · ist gekommen","来","to come","Woher kommst du?","你是哪里人？","Where are you from?"],["machen","v","macht · machte · hat gemacht","做","to do; to make","Was machst du am Wochenende?","你周末做什么？","What are you doing at the weekend?"],["wollen","v","will · wollte · hat gewollt","想要","to want","Ich will Portugiesisch lernen.","我想学葡萄牙语。","I want to learn Portuguese."],["können","v","kann · konnte · hat gekonnt","能，会","can; to be able to","Kannst du mir helfen?","你能帮我吗？","Can you help me?"],["essen","v","isst · aß · hat gegessen","吃","to eat","Wir essen um sieben.","我们七点吃饭。","We eat at seven."],["trinken","v","trinkt · trank · hat getrunken","喝","to drink","Was möchtest du trinken?","你想喝点什么？","What would you like to drink?"],["schlafen","v","schläft · schlief · hat geschlafen","睡觉","to sleep","Hast du gut geschlafen?","你睡得好吗？","Did you sleep well?"],["arbeiten","v","arbeitet · arbeitete · hat gearbeitet","工作","to work","Sie arbeitet bei einer großen Firma.","她在一家大公司工作。","She works for a big company."],["wohnen","v","wohnt · wohnte · hat gewohnt","居住","to live (reside)","Ich wohne in der Nähe vom Park.","我住在公园附近。","I live near the park."],["sprechen","v","spricht · sprach · hat gesprochen","说","to speak","Sprechen Sie Englisch?","您说英语吗？","Do you speak English?"],["kaufen","v","kauft · kaufte · hat gekauft","买","to buy","Ich kaufe noch schnell Brot.","我再赶紧去买个面包。","I'll just quickly buy some bread."],["gut","adj","besser · am besten","好的","good","Das Essen hier ist sehr gut.","这里的饭菜很好。","The food here is very good."],["groß","adj","größer · am größten","大的；高的","big; tall","Er ist sehr groß.","他个子很高。","He is very tall."],["klein","adj","kleiner · am kleinsten","小的","small","Die Wohnung ist klein, aber gemütlich.","公寓虽小但很舒适。","The flat is small but cosy."],["neu","adj","neuer · am neuesten","新的","new","Ich brauche ein neues Handy.","我需要一部新手机。","I need a new phone."],["schön","adj","schöner · am schönsten","美的；好的","beautiful; nice","Schönes Wochenende!","周末愉快！","Have a nice weekend!"],["warm","adj","wärmer · am wärmsten","温暖的","warm","Heute ist es angenehm warm.","今天暖和宜人。","It's pleasantly warm today."],["kalt","adj","kälter · am kältesten","冷的","cold","Im Januar ist es sehr kalt.","一月很冷。","It's very cold in January."],["heute","adv","","今天","today","Heute koche ich.","今天我做饭。","I'm cooking today."],["morgen","adv","","明天","tomorrow","Bis morgen!","明天见！","See you tomorrow!"],["hier","adv","","这里","here","Ist hier noch frei?","这里还有人坐吗？","Is this seat free?"],["sehr","adv","","很，非常","very","Vielen Dank, das ist sehr nett.","非常感谢，你真好。","Thanks a lot, that's very kind."],["auch","adv","","也","also; too","Ich komme auch mit.","我也一起去。","I'm coming along too."],["bitte","expr","","请；不客气","please; you're welcome","Einen Kaffee, bitte.","请来一杯咖啡。","A coffee, please."],["danke","expr","","谢谢","thank you","Danke für deine Hilfe!","谢谢你的帮助！","Thanks for your help!"],["Entschuldigung","expr","","对不起；打扰一下","sorry; excuse me","Entschuldigung, wo ist die Toilette?","打扰一下，洗手间在哪儿？","Excuse me, where is the toilet?"],["die Mutter","f","die Mütter","母亲","mother","Meine Mutter wohnt in Hamburg.","我妈妈住在汉堡。","My mother lives in Hamburg."],["der Vater","m","die Väter","父亲","father","Mein Vater kocht sehr gern.","我爸爸很喜欢做饭。","My father loves cooking."],["die Familie","f","die Familien","家庭","family","Am Sonntag besuche ich meine Familie.","星期天我去看望家人。","On Sunday I visit my family."],["der Bruder","m","die Brüder","兄弟","brother","Mein Bruder ist zwei Jahre älter.","我哥哥比我大两岁。","My brother is two years older."],["die Schwester","f","die Schwestern","姐妹","sister","Meine Schwester studiert in Berlin.","我姐姐在柏林上大学。","My sister studies in Berlin."],["das Haus","n","die Häuser","房子","house","Das Haus hat einen kleinen Garten.","这栋房子有个小花园。","The house has a small garden."],["die Straße","f","die Straßen","街道","street","Ich wohne in einer ruhigen Straße.","我住在一条安静的街上。","I live on a quiet street."],["der Bus","m","die Busse","